'''''Lupinus cosentinii''''', or '''sand lupine''', is a species of ''[[Lupinus]]'' found in Algeria, Corse, Italy, Libya, Morocco, Portugal, Sardegna, Sicilia, Spain, and Tunisia. <ref name="l854">{{cite web | title=Plants of the World Online | website=Plants of the World Online | url=https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:137922-3 | access-date=2025-06-28}}</ref>

